{"id":"zatem","lemma":"затем","pos":"adv","rank":311,"glosses":["then, thereupon, after that","for that purpose, that’s why"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6e/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"То, что случилось затем, было ужасно.","en":"What happened next was terrible.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"terribly, horribly"}]},{"text":"Затем мне в голову пришла хорошая идея.","en":"A good idea occurred to me then.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},{"g":"idea, thought, notion"}]},{"text":"Том всё потерял, а затем начал всё сначала.","en":"Tom lost everything and then started over.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"потерять"},{"g":"and / but"},null,{"g":"to begin","l":"начать"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"at first"}]},{"text":"Что затем сделал Том?","en":"What did Tom do then?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"}]},{"text":"Никто не был готов к тому, что затем случилось.","en":"No one was prepared for what happened next.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"Goth","l":"гот"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"}]}]}